@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@customerOrderId = 1

### Customer order acknowledgement PDF in the customer's language
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pdf/customerorder/{{customerOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown customer order PDF returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pdf/customerorder/2147483647
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}